It was not pretty at all but I finally ascended.

This is the gnomish wizard I've been posting about for a few days.
Highlights:  Blew up an early BoH.  Sacced for Magicbane, Mjollnir, and
Frosty, when all I really wanted was +'s.  Had to dig away and escape
Medusa's Titan.  Finally got some good armor with the wand at the
Castle.  Got in some trouble when I first went down to the VotD - I
didn't know it was nodig and I was trying my patented dig-away move.
So I was in a pit, surrounded by nasties, when I got green-slimed.  I
wished for the Staff of Aesculapius to unslime, then wished for a
cockatrice corpse and managed to kill the stonable monsters from the
(haha) safety of my pit.

Got crowned on one of my trips out of Gehennom.  Made myself some stone
grenades, but after I had finger of death I hardly needed them.  (I
made a whole horde of chickatrices, too, but I left them in Sokoban.)
A friggin water nymph stole my AoLS in the castle and I stoned her, and
I tried stoning an air elemental on the Plane of Air (didn't work).

Everything below VotD was totally new to me.  One of the named demons
was peaceful, but demanded some money, so I paid him.  Jubilex was a
wuss, as was the Wizard.  All the priests of Moloch I ran into were
much tougher - that spell they cast where terrible wounds appear on
your body is rough.

My only strategy, I guess, was to alternate wielding +2 MB and +1
Healer Staff.  It's worth getting blasted by the staff to get free
regeneration and protection from vamps, and once my HP were back up I'd
switch back to MB to eat curses.

The mysterious force was kind - I think it only hit me five or six
times?  And I only killed Rodney 5 times.  I almost died on Air before
it occured to me to wear my ring of conflict, d'oh.  then I forgot to
take it off when I got to Astral, so I got surrounded by really pissy
angels.  Oh well.  And I lost my ESP on Astral, when a peaceful priest
got in my line of sight while I was death-zapping Pest.  Oh well again.
 They're a really ungrateful lot up there.

Death is a wimp.  Also, Gehennom is much nicer after you geno all L.
Wraiths are tasty.

Oh yeah - I died once.  Cockatrice corpse + stairs, my second-favorite
way to die other than simply picking one up without gloves.





